 "remarks": "Bright, spacious, and completely renovated 1-bedroom, 1-full-bath end unit in the heart of Stamford! This beautifully updated unit features an open-concept living and dining area with gleaming hardwood floors, recessed ceiling lighting, and a sunny private balcony off the living room. The spacious bedroom offers plenty of closet space, while the brand-new bathroom and updated kitchen with newer appliances add a fresh, modern touch. Freshly painted throughout and equipped with newer A/C units and an in-unit washer/dryer. The building offers an elevator, beautiful in-ground pool, community meeting room, reserved parking, and plenty of guest parking. Rent includes Wi-Fi! Fantastic location close to downtown Stamford, restaurants, shopping, theaters, the train station, and I-95-everything you need is right outside your door!",
